Career-Copilot — licensing
==========================

This repository has mixed provenance, so no single licence covers all of it.
Read this before reusing any part of it. Full detail is in NOTICE.md.


1. Derived components — NO LICENCE GRANTED
------------------------------------------

The examination and proctoring layer — user/exam management, the Flask
application shell, and the webcam proctoring pipeline (camera.py,
face_detector.py, face_landmarks.py, verify_face.py, and the associated
templates and static assets) — is derived from MyProctor.ai by Narender Kumar:

    https://github.com/narender-rk10/MyProctor.ai-AI-BASED-SMART-ONLINE-EXAMINATION-PROCTORING-SYSYTEM

That upstream project carries no explicit licence. Under copyright law the
default is that all rights are reserved, which means the author of this
repository holds no rights to sublicense those portions and does not purport
to grant any. They are present here for academic and research purposes.

If you want to reuse or redistribute those portions, contact the upstream
author for permission. Do not rely on this repository as your grant of rights.


