3. Third-party assets
---------------------

models/ contains OpenCV's pre-trained face detection models, distributed by
the OpenCV project under Apache 2.0.

sample_face.jpg is the "astronaut" image from scikit-image: a NASA portrait of
Eileen Collins, in the public domain. It replaces the Lena/Lenna image, which
the IEEE Computer Society stopped accepting in submissions from 1 April 2024.
